  "description": "20\" Motor eBike – Fat Tire Power for All-Terrain Adventures with 800W Motor & 50 Mile Range!\nGet ready to ride in style with the Tracer 20\" Motor eBike, the ultimate fat tire ebike for all-terrain adventures. Built with a sturdy Hi-Ten steel frame and a triple tree fork, this eBike ensures durability and smooth handling. Equipped with 3\" alloy matte black FAT rims and 20\"x4.0 fat black tires, it offers exceptional grip and stability. The 48V 800W high-speed brushless motor provides impressive power, while the pedal assist system with an intelligent 12-magnet cadence sensor adapts to your riding style. Featuring a 48V/17.5Ah lithium battery, an LCD display screen, and disc brakes, this eBike offers both convenience and performance for a thrilling ride. Whether you're cruising around town or exploring rough trails, the Tracer 20\" Motor eBike is built to take you further!\n\nBottom Bracket",
